# POS-SOV05 -- W4-FIX-POS acceptance: the Eiffel Tower (CAPARS01 4x4, L6) with
# its legs on the plaza, the Arc de Triomphe (CAPARS11 3x4) on the road hub,
# the neighbouring civilian tenements on their paved lots.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign SOV05U.MAP Nod
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 400 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 30
cheat reveal
cheat view_building CAPARS01
wait 2
shot eiffel
cheat view_building CAPARS11
wait 2
shot arc
